/li>\n                </ul>\n            </article>\n\n            <article style=\"background-color: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.3s;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Day 3: Culinary Experience</h2>\n                <ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0;\">\n                    <li>✦ Tsukiji Outer Market tour</li>\n                    <li>✦ Sushi making class</li>\n                    <li>✦ Izakaya dining experience</li>\n                </ul>\n            </article>\n\n            <article style=\"background-color: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.3s;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Day 4: Nature & Zen</h2>\n                <ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0;\">\n                    <li>✦ Meiji Shrine visit</li>\n                    <li>✦ Zen meditation session</li>\n                    <li>✦ Ueno Park exploration</li>\n                </ul>\n            </article>\n\n            <article style=\"background-color: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.3s;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 10px;\">Day 5: Art & Performance</h2>\n                <ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0;\">\n                    <li>✦ Tokyo National Museum</li>\n                    <li>✦ Kabuki theater performance</li>\n                    <li>✦ Contemporary art galleries</li>\n                </ul>\n            </article>\n\n            <article style=\"background-color: white; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.3s;\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: