dient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px; font-size: 1.8rem;\">🎨</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-align: center;\">Arts & Crafts</h2>\n                    <p style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Visit teamLab Borderless digital art museum, try traditional origami and calligraphy workshops, explore Harajuku's modern art scene.</p>\n                    <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Morning:</strong> teamLab Borderless</p>\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Afternoon:</strong> Calligraphy Workshop</p>\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;\"><strong>Evening:</strong> Roppongi Art Triangle</p>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n\n                <article style=\"background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 25px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: relative; transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-5px)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)';\" onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='translateY(0)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)';\">\n                    <div style=\"position: absolute; top: -15px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #667eea; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;\">Day 5</div>\n                    <div style=\"width: 60px; height: 60px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px; f