ern Traditions</h2>\n                    <p style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">Experience a sumo practice session, shop for traditional crafts in Yanaka, farewell dinner with kaiseki cuisine.</p>\n                    <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Morning:</strong> Sumo Stable Visit</p>\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Afternoon:</strong> Yanaka Old Town</p>\n                        <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;\"><strong>Evening:</strong> Kaiseki Farewell Dinner</p>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <section style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px; margin-top: 60px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n            <h2 style=\"color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-align: center;\">Trip Essentials</h2>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;\">\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px;\">🚇</div>\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 5px 0;\">Transportation</h3>\n                    <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;\">JR Pass & Suica Card</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px;\">\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px;\">🏨</div>\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #4a5568; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 5px 0;\">Accommodation</h3>\n                    <p style=\"color: #718096; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;\">Shinjuku or